<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Cunstore</h1>
<p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>cunstore &lt;item&gt;
cunstore 2.&lt;item&gt;      the second item by that name
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>cunstore sword
</pre>
<p>Takes an item out of your clan's secret storage, from under the false 
bottom of the clan chest. Only the clan Master and the members appointed 
quartermaster can do this (see <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Quartermaster</a>), and only at the 
clan chest in the clan house. To see what is stored, use 
<a cmd='#'>Help Cequipment</a>.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cstore</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Cequipment</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Quartermaster</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Clan Commands</a>
</pre>




</div>